      "sequence_position": 4,
      "problem": "What is the recursive formula for the following geometric sequence?\n\n$$\n5,\\,1,\\,\\frac{1}{5},\\,…\n$$",
      "worked_solution": "The recursive formula for a geometric sequence with common ratio $r$ takes the form\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=r\\cdot {a}_{n}.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the first term is ${a}_{1}=5,$ and we can calculate the common ratio $r$ as\n\n$$\nr=\\frac{{a}_{2}}{{a}_{1}}=\\frac{1}{5}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the recursive formula is\n\n$$\n{a}_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{5}{a}_{n},\\,{a}_{1}=5,\\,n\\ge 1.\n$$",
